# NOITE's gym (4fsalgin) starts the real SALGIN, which wins: NOITE gets
# 0x40c (hides), then 0x40a, shows itself, adds the score and goes to the
# garden cutscene (espquete, which starts JARDIM).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fsalgin --ms 72000 --input tools/play/salgin-4fsalgin-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fsalgin --ms 72000 --fix all --input tools/play/salgin-4fsalgin-win.input
#
# The sportsman's animation ends at 8733 (the WinExec); SALGIN starts 1500
# ms later (10233). Up is held from 11000 (salgin-alone-win.input): the KO
# is on the beat at 61233 in both versions, the window closes at 65333.
# The Original's player keeps 83 energy (+8300), the Corrigida's 82
# (+8200: S5's single seed picks other attacks).
10500 dump gym
11000 hold up 52000
12000 dump fight
70000 result won 8300 | won 8200
70000 expect espquete
70000 state
70000 dump espquete
